      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "WATCHING BIRDS (6) held a forward position from the pinch but began to paddle on the bend and drifted out of the finish when 7th at this track in Maiden company. Some good form is emerging from her last run. Should be very hard to beat this time. LOVE SHAKE (1) has an honest record despite remaining a maiden and overdue for a win, having placed five of 12 career runs. Can measure up. SUNSHINE TILLY (2) has the advantage of a nice draw for her first outing. Expected to play a major role. MIXED EMOTIONS (8) with some luck can improve on an unplaced run last time here.",
